mory","why":"Provides the agent a stable session key and recent-context window for multi-turn conversations."}}},{"id":"tool_sql_read","type":"custom","position":{"x":420,"y":395},"data":{"icon":"Database","type":"postgresql","label":"Run Read-Only SQL Context","category":"data","config":{"query":"SELECT 'Use a read-only analytics role and replace this with a safe SELECT for {{input.message}}' AS guidance"},"notes":{"family":"Data","what":"Connects to a PostgreSQL database to run queries or insert data","overview":"Run PostgreSQL executeQuery, insert, update, or delete through the real database executor. The visual panel now uses runtime operation values and Parameters maps to the executor parameter array.","tips":["Use executeQuery for raw SQL with $1, $2 placeholders and Parameters as a JSON array.","Insert returns inserted/count; update and delete return rows/rowsAffected because PostgreSQL uses RETURNING *.","The backend schema still lists connectionString, but the executor validates host, username, password, database, port, and ssl.","Update and delete require Where; the executor refuses missing where clauses.","Store database passwords in Connections rather than ordinary workflow fields."],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/postgresql","why":"Provides read-only warehouse context; production users should connect a role that cannot mutate data."}}},{"id":"ai_agent","type":"custom","position":{"x":740,"y":300},"data":{"icon":"Bot","type":"ai_agent","label":"AI Agent","category":"ai","config":{"model":"gemini-3.5-flash","temperature":0.2,"userInput":"Process this workflow input and any attached tool results: {{input}}","systemPrompt":"You are a data analyst. Use only read-only SQL context, explain numbers plainly, and set needsFollowup true if the question cannot be answered from available rows. Return ONLY JSON with the fields named in this workflow.","outputFormat":"json","memoryScope":"conversation","requireApprovalFor":"destructive"},"notes":{"family":"AI","what":"An autonomous AI brain that reasons, makes decisions, and uses tools on your behalf","overview":"Runs one prompt-driven AI step. The runtime extracts userInput from this node or upstream message-like fields, infers the provider from Model, calls the LLM adapter, and packages response_text plus optional structured fields.","tips":[],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/ai_agent","why":"Applies the source AI-agent prompt to the current request and attached read-side context, returning structured JSON for deterministic downstream steps."}}},{"id":"js_parse_agent","type":"custom","position":{"x":1060,"y":300},"data":{"icon":"Code","type":"javascript","label":"Parse Agent JSON","category":"data","config":{"code":"const raw = input.response_text || input.output || input.response || input.text || input.content || \"\";\nlet parsed = {};\ntry {\n  const match = String(raw).match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n  parsed = match ? JSON.parse(match[0]) : {};\n} catch (error) {\n  parsed = {};\n}\nconst message = parsed.message || parsed.reply || parsed.emailBody || parsed.body || parsed.summary || String(raw);\nreturn { ...input, ...parsed, responseText: String(raw), message };","timeout":5000},"notes":{"family":"Data","what":"Writes and runs any JavaScript you like to transform or process your data","overview":"Run sandboxed JavaScript once against the current workflow data and return the transformed value for downstream nodes.","tips":["Always return the value the next node should receive","Default timeout is 5000ms and runtime caps at 30000ms","Use Output Schema such as {\"type\":\"object\"} only as a top-level shape hint","JavaScript has no credentials; connect downstream service node accounts separately","Do not paste API keys, tokens, or passwords into code"],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/javascript","why":"Turns the agent response into top-level fields before any branch or output node reads it."}}},{"id":"chat_data_answer","type":"custom","position":{"x":1380,"y":300},"data":{"icon":"Send","type":"chat_send","label":"Reply with Analysis","category":"output","config":{"message":"{{input.message}}"},"notes":{"family":"Database","what":"Sends a reply in a chat conversation — works with a chat trigger to create a bot","overview":"","tips":[],"docsHref":null,"why":"Returns the analysis to the analyst in chat."}}}]$tpl$::jsonb, $tpl$[{"id":"e_1_chat_intake_memory_context","source":"chat_intake","target":"memory_context"},{"id":"e_2_memory_context_ai_agent","source":"memory_context","target":"ai_agent","targetHandle":"memory"},{"id":"e_3_chat_intake_tool_sql_read","source":"chat_intake","target":"tool_sql_read"},{"id":"e_4_tool_sql_read_ai_agent","source":"tool_sql_read","target":"ai_agent","targetHandle":"tool"},{"id":"e_5_chat_intake_ai_agent","source":"chat_intake","target":"ai_agent","targetHandle":"userInput"},{"id":"e_6_ai_agent_js_parse_agent","source":"ai_agent","target":"js_parse_agent"},{"id":"e_7_js_parse_agent_chat_data_answer","source":"js_parse_agent","target":"chat_data_answer"}]$tpl$::jsonb, $tpl$Intermediate$tpl$,
