load.body.data","Use search to filter messages before getting details"],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/google_gmail","why":"Sends the routine response or acknowledgement without requiring a manual handoff."}}},{"id":"store_result","type":"custom","position":{"x":1700,"y":300},"data":{"icon":"Database","type":"mongodb","label":"Archive Event Document","category":"data","config":{"operation":"insertOne","collection":"inbox_triage_events","document":{"from":"{{input.from}}","subject":"{{input.subject}}","snippet":"{{input.snippet}}","category":"{{input.category}}","urgent":"{{input.urgent}}","summary":"{{input.summary}}","source":"ai-inbox-triage-auto-label"}},"notes":{"family":"Data","what":"Reads from or writes to a MongoDB document database","overview":"Run MongoDB driver operations against one collection. The visible panel exposes find, insertOne, updateOne, and deleteOne; generated config can also use insertMany, updateMany, deleteMany, and aggregate.","tips":["Use Filter, not legacy Query; the runtime does not read a query field","Find and aggregate return documents/count","Insert returns insertedId or insertedIds and insertedCount","Update returns matchedCount/modifiedCount/upserted fields","Delete returns deletedCount and acknowledged"],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/mongodb","why":"Archives the full event-style result as one MongoDB document, which fits variable payloads better than a fixed SQL row."}}}]$tpl$::jsonb,
