tials; connect downstream service node accounts separately","Do not paste API keys, tokens, or passwords into code"],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/javascript","why":"Takes the raw chat message and prepares it as a search term. Written to work whether the chat trigger hands over a string or an object."}},"type":"custom","position":{"x":420,"y":300}},{"id":"airtable_search_vault","data":{"icon":"Database","type":"airtable","label":"Search Document Vault","config":{"baseId":"","tableId":"DocumentVault","operation":"read","maxRecords":200},"category":"data","notes":{"family":"Data","what":"Reads rows from an Airtable base or adds new records — like a smarter spreadsheet","overview":"List, get, create, update, upsert, and delete Airtable records. The resource dropdown is visual only; runtime implements record operations, not table-management APIs.","tips":["Use a Personal Access Token with data.records scopes or a saved Airtable connection","Base ID plus table/tableId are required for every operation","Create/update/upsert return records/count","Upsert also returns created and updated counts","Delete returns deletedRecords/count, not top-level deleted:true"],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/airtable","why":"Reads the tagged vault built by the Intake template. Capped so a large vault cannot overflow the agent's prompt."}},"type":"custom","position":{"x":740,"y":300}},{"id":"ai_agent_find_match","data":{"icon":"Bot","type":"ai_agent","label":"Find the Matching File","config":{"model":"gemini-3.5-flash","userInput":"Search query: {{input.searchQuery}}\nAvailable documents: {{input.records}}","temperature":0.2,"systemPrompt":"You are a document vault search assistant. You are given a search query and a list of tagged documents (client, type, date, link). Find the single best match and reply with a short sentence containing its file link. If nothing matches well, say so and suggest what to search instead."},"category":"ai","notes":{"family":"AI","what":"An autonomous AI brain that reasons, makes decisions, and uses tools on your behalf","overview":"Runs one prompt-driven AI step. The runtime extracts userInput from this node or upstream message-like fields, infers the provider from Model, calls the LLM adapter, and packages response_text plus optional structured fields.","tips":[],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/ai_agent","why":"Matches a loose human request ('that PAN card from March') against the tagged records and picks the best one."}},"type":"custom","position":{"x":1060,"y":300}},{"id":"whatsapp_reply_search","data":{"icon":"Send","type":"chat_send","label":"Reply in Chat","config":{"message":"{{input.response}}"},"category":"output","notes":{"family":"Database","what":"Sends a reply in a chat conversation — works with a chat trigger to create a bot","overview":"","tips":[],"docsHref":null,"why":"Returns the matched file link in the same chat where the request was made."}},"type":"custom","position":{"x":1380,"y":300}}]$tpl$::jsonb,
    edges                = $tpl$[{"id":"e3","source":"chat_trigger_search","target":"js_parse_search_query"},{"id":"e4","source":"js_parse_search_query","target":"airtable_search_vault"},{"id":"e5","source":"airtable_search_vault","target":"ai_agent_find_match"},{"id":"e6","source":"ai_agent_find_match","target":"whatsapp_reply_search"}]$tpl$::jsonb,
    difficulty           = $tpl$Advanced$tpl$,
