opy for manual posting. Return linkedin, xDraft, instagramDraft, and summary. Return ONLY JSON with the fields named in this workflow.","outputFormat":"json","memoryScope":"none","requireApprovalFor":"destructive"},"notes":{"family":"AI","what":"An autonomous AI brain that reasons, makes decisions, and uses tools on your behalf","overview":"Runs one prompt-driven AI step. The runtime extracts userInput from this node or upstream message-like fields, infers the provider from Model, calls the LLM adapter, and packages response_text plus optional structured fields.","tips":[],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/ai_agent","why":"Applies the source AI-agent prompt to the current request and attached read-side context, returning structured JSON for deterministic downstream steps."}}},{"id":"js_parse_agent","type":"custom","position":{"x":1060,"y":300},"data":{"icon":"Code","type":"javascript","label":"Parse Agent JSON","category":"data","config":{"code":"const raw = input.response_text || input.output || input.response || input.text || input.content || \"\";\nlet parsed = {};\ntry {\n  const match = String(raw).match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n  parsed = match ? JSON.parse(match[0]) : {};\n} catch (error) {\n  parsed = {};\n}\nconst message = parsed.message || parsed.reply || parsed.emailBody || parsed.body || parsed.summary || String(raw);\nreturn { ...input, ...parsed, responseText: String(raw), message };","timeout":5000},"notes":{"family":"Data","what":"Writes and runs any JavaScript you like to transform or process your data","overview":"Run sandboxed JavaScript once against the current workflow data and return the transformed value for downstream nodes.","tips":["Always return the value the next node should receive","Default timeout is 5000ms and runtime caps at 30000ms","Use Output Schema such as {\"type\":\"object\"} only as a top-level shape hint","JavaScript has no credentials; connect downstream service node accounts separately","Do not paste API keys, tokens, or passwords into code"],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/javascript","why":"Turns the agent response into top-level fields before any branch or output node reads it."}}},{"id":"linkedin_publish_post","type":"custom","position":{"x":1380,"y":300},"data":{"icon":"Linkedin","type":"linkedin","label":"Publish LinkedIn Post","category":"output","config":{"operation":"create_post","text":"{{input.linkedin}}"},"notes":{"family":"Communication","what":"Posts updates to LinkedIn or reads professional network content","overview":"Use LinkedIn OAuth to get your profile, read recent posts, publish personal/company/article/media posts, delete posts, or dry-run a simulated API request before publishing.","tips":["Connect LinkedIn in Connections; accessToken is only a legacy fallback","Get My Profile verifies OAuth and returns profile.personUrn","Create Post (Media) requires a public Media URL; text can be empty only for media posts","Company Page posts require Organization ID and page/admin permission","Dry Run returns simulatedRequest and does not publish, upload, or delete"],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/linkedin","why":"Keeps the verified LinkedIn publishing leg from the source template."}}},{"id":"slack_manual_social_drafts","type":"custom","position":{"x":1700,"y":300},"data":{"icon":"Hash","type":"slack_message","label":"Send Manual Social Drafts","category":"output","config":{"channel":"#content-review","message":"Manual X/Instagram drafts:\nX: {{input.xDraft}}\nInstagram: {{input.instagramDraft}}"},"notes":{"family":"Communication","what":"Sends messages using a Slack app or bot connection","overview":"Send Slack bot messages to channels, direct messages, or existing threads through a saved Slack OAuth2 connection. Use it for workplace alerts, support replies, incident updates, approvals, report summaries, and deployment notifications.","tips":["Select a Slack OAuth2 connection; do not paste bot tokens into message fields","The Slack app needs chat:write, and the bot must be invited before it can post in private channels","Use {{$json.channelId}} and {{$json.threadTs}} from Slack Trigger to reply in the same conversation","Keep Message filled as readable fallback text even when Blocks contains a rich Block Kit layout","Connect downstream service accounts separately; Slack OAuth2 only authorizes the Slack send"],"docsHref":"/docs/nodes/slack_message","why":"Replaces blocked Twitter and Instagram publishing with reviewable manual-posting drafts."}}}]$tpl$::jsonb, $tpl$[{"id":"e_1_schedule_intake_tool_latest_content","source":"schedule_intake","target":"tool_latest_content"},{"id":"e_2_tool_latest_content_ai_agent","source":"tool_latest_content","target":"ai_agent","targetHandle":"tool"},{"id":"e_3_schedule_intake_ai_agent","source":"schedule_intake","target":"ai_agent","targetHandle":"userInput"},{"id":"e_4_ai_agent_js_parse_agent","source":"ai_agent","target":"js_parse_agent"},{"id":"e_5_js_parse_agent_linkedin_publish_post","source":"js_parse_agent","target":"linkedin_publish_post"},{"id":"e_6_linkedin_publish_post_slack_manual_social_drafts","source":"linkedin_publish_post","target":"slack_manual_social_drafts"}]$tpl$::jsonb, $tpl$Intermediate$tpl$,
